  "description": "KA.Barcode Reader for QR Code from TIFF is a VB.NET barcode scanner library to read, scan QR Code barcode from TIFF in your ASP.NET Core web and Windows applications.\n\nThis package includes detailed example VB.NET source code to scan, read, decode QR Code data message from TIFF file in .NET projects.\n\nGuides:\n* How to Guide : https://www.keepautomation.com/guide/vbnet_barcode_reader.html\n* Email : support@keepautomation.com",
